#: includes/abilities/discovery/get-widget-schema.php:92
msgid "A JSON Schema object. Its properties map each control/prop key to its type, and — where relevant — enum, default and depends_on (the control's visibility prerequisite). depends_on is one of two shapes: a flat { key: value, \"key!\": value } map (implicit AND; \"!\" suffix means not-equal, an array value means in/not-in), or a nested { relation, terms } tree with explicit per-term operators (===, !==, in, <, contains). Filtered to the type's own settings: internal (_-prefixed) controls, editor-hidden controls, Elementor-injected common sections (motion effects, transform, background, responsive, custom CSS) and the Premium Addons global-addon sections (Floating Effects, Tooltips, Display Conditions, …) are all removed."
msgstr "A JSON Schema object. Its properties map each control/prop key to its type, and — where relevant — enum, default and depends_on (the control's visibility prerequisite). depends_on is one of two shapes: a flat { key: value, \"key!\": value } map (implicit AND; \"!\" suffix means not-equal, an array value means in/not-in), or a nested { relation, terms } tree with explicit per-term operators (===, !==, in, <, contains). Filtered to the type's own settings: internal (_-prefixed) controls, editor-hidden controls, Elementor-injected common sections (motion effects, transform, background, responsive, custom CSS) and the Premium Addons global-addon sections (Floating Effects, Tooltips, Display Conditions, …) are all removed."

